  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どこか思い当たる場所があるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001110020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "別にそういうわけじゃないんだけど……\r\n地方ロケだと旅行気分が味わえて楽しいじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100111/1802001001110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、欲望に正直だな\r\nそうだな、地方ロケか……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "そういう機会も\r\nあるかもな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001111"
  },
  {
    "select": "たしかに、\r\n楽しそうだな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001112"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "じゃあ、\r\n頑張らないとな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001113"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001110030,
    "label": "1802001001111",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……ふぅん\r\n否定はしないってことね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100111/1802001001110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001110040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ダメもとで言ってみただけなのに\r\n可能性があると思うと前向きに頑張れそうね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100111/1802001001110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001110050,
    "label": "1802001001112",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でしょ。子役時代は地方ロケもよく行ってたけど\r\n最近はなかなか、そういう機会もなかったから……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100111/1802001001110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001110060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "今すぐは無理だと思うけど\r\nいずれは実現できると嬉しいわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
